  "hooks": [
    {
      "text": "地图没有固定路径或边界，来袭敌人还会主动反击防御设施",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Maps have no path, no limits, and most importantly... Enemies will fight back.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/2392280/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "Vessel同时是可操控单位与防御塔，可采矿、战斗并建设专属塔系",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Control a Vessel, they are your anchor to the world. Vessels in themselves are both a unit and a tower. Control them to mine, fight, and build your defense. Each of which comes with their own set of extremely unique towers to help in this endeavor.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/2392280/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "塔与Vessel的升级会互相联动，可做单塔极限强化或构筑整面防线",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Towers, units. Simple yet deep. Expand your defense through an extremely rich set of upgrades that all play off one another. Synergistic in nature, there are many combinations and strategies you can employ to increase your effective hold. Towers can expand on one another, Vessels can too.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/2392280/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    }
  ],
